  "practice": [
    "Say ঠ three times with the tongue curled slightly backward and a strong puff of air: ṭhô, ṭhô, ṭhô.",
    "Practice the vowel forms: ঠ (ṭhô), ঠা (ṭha), ঠি (ṭhi), ঠী (ṭhi), ঠু (ṭhu), ঠূ (ṭhu), ঠে (ṭhe), ঠৈ (ṭhoi), ঠো (ṭho), and ঠৌ (ṭhou).",
    "Read the common combinations aloud: ঠ + া = ঠা as in ঠান্ডা, ঠ + ি = ঠি as in ঠিক, ঠ + ু = ঠু as in ঠুকা, ঠ + ে = ঠে as in ঠেলা, and ঠ + ো = ঠো as in ঠোঁট.",
    "Memorize the opposite pair ঠান্ডা ↔ গরম: cold ↔ hot.",
    "Notice the chandrabindu ঁ in ঠোঁট and practice reading ঠোঁট and ঠোঁটে.",
    "Contrast ট and ঠ with your hand near your mouth: ট has little air; ঠ has a noticeable puff.",
    "Find ঠ inside মুঠো, পাঠানো, পাঠ, কাঠ, মাঠ, পিঠ, আঠা, ওঠা, উঠে, বসে ওঠা, and হঠাৎ.",
    "Use ঠিক, ঠান্ডা, ঠিকানা, ঠিকঠাক, ঠোঁট, ঠেলা, ঠেকানো, ঠকানো, and ঠাট্টা as reading anchors.",
    "Recognize these phrases instantly: ঠিক আছে, সব ঠিক আছে, আমার ঠান্ডা লাগছে, দরজাটা ঠেলো, and আমি ঠাট্টা করছি."
  ],
  "notes": [
    "ঠ is called মূর্ধন্য ঠ (murdhonno ṭhô). It is an aspirated retroflex consonant made with the tongue curled slightly backward and a strong puff of air.",
    "ঠ is not the English th sound in think. It is the aspirated partner of ট: ট has little air, while ঠ has a noticeable puff.",
    "ঠিক is one of the most useful ঠ words and can mean correct, okay, or exactly depending on context.",
    "The word ঠোঁট contains the chandrabindu ঁ, which marks nasalization.",
    "Best words to memorize include ঠিক, ঠিক আছে, ঠান্ডা, ঠিকানা, ঠিকঠাক, ঠোঁট, ঠেলা, ঠেকানো, ঠকানো, ঠাট্টা, ঠাকুরমা, and ঠাকুরদা, plus common words containing ঠ such as ওঠা, উঠে, পিঠ, মাঠ, কাঠ, পাঠ, হঠাৎ, and মুঠো."
  ]
